st of high-level key differences with impacts and recommended actions.\n- An executive summary with the most important items to negotiate or review.\n\nGuidance on significance classification (how I’ll decide)\n- Major: Material differences that affect obligations, risk allocation, liability, payment, IP, termination rights, or compliance.\n- Minor: Editorial differences, clarifications, thresholds, or timing issues that do not fundamentally reallocate risk.\n- Identical: Substantially the same language or meaning.\n\nNext step\n- Paste the two contract texts or upload the section summaries and I will run a detailed comparison.\n\nPrepared to proceed as soon as you provide the documents.",
